{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261103/photo/bkn-20261103093143232-1103_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261103100729\"/><p>消防在店內調查。（吳鎮興攝）</p><p>深水埗發生火警。今日(3日)早上9時27分，有多名市民報案，指汝州街218至224號地下一間售賣膠袋的店舖起火冒煙。消防員接報到場開喉灌救，同時搜救隊到場協助救援，迅速將火勢救熄。消防員在店舖近後巷位置，發現有膠袋燒毀，正調查起火原因。事件中，無人受傷及毋須疏散。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T02:22:02.485401+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T01:31:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T03:59:18.223257+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T02:19:13.344309+00:00","content_hash":"fe81f0ab798ebd42052c2613a947d8463f3c391595c15e64e98c5b9d9b975dd3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}